<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><body>
<h1>Verify your email</h1>
<p>Enter this code in the browser where you registered:</p>
<p><strong>{{ .VerificationCode }}</strong></p>
{{ $flow := regexFind "[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}" .VerificationURL }}
<p><a href="http://127.0.0.1:3000/verify?flow={{ $flow }}#code={{ .VerificationCode }}">Open the verification form</a>, then choose Verify email.</p>
<p>Use the latest email for that form. Resending replaces the previous code. This code expires in {{ .ExpiresInMinutes }} minutes.</p>
<p>If the link opens in another browser, return to the browser where you registered and enter the code there. Without JavaScript, enter the code manually.</p>
<p>If you did not request this, ignore this email.</p>
</body></html>
